WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.800
&gt;&gt; Hello, I wanted to talk seriously and honestly for a moment about

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.460
my thoughts on what's been going on for the past couple months, and hopefully

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.920
You can get a better understanding

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.080
Of my perspective.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.480
I think it's time to end the "Subscribe To PewDiePie" movement or meme.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:24.520
It's something that started off as a way to keep me as the number one, most subscribed channel on YouTube,

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.820
and

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.360
seeing so many people come to my support, other creators as well,

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.240
has been incredibly humbling to me.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.140
It's really really meant a lot.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.620
It's something I never thought I would experience

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:43.600
And it's something I thought would last almost for maybe just a couple of days, or maybe a week. But here we are.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:49.600
It's been six to seven months now and it's been a crazy journey. At first it started off with

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:55.140
people doing really positive and fun things to get attention through "Subscribe To PewDiePie"

00:00:55.140 --> 00:01:01.520
But something I learned and I think hopefully it's something people can understand is when you have 90 million people

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:07.420
riled up about something, you're bound to get a few degenerates, and it started off with someone

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:16.440
spray-painting "Sub To Pewdiepie" on a World War II memorial and just so disgusting, so disappointing, to have my name and community

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.480
dragged into that, I

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:24.100
addressed it on Twitter, I disavowed it. We saw that it got removed, and- and donated to the park.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.920
Hoped that that was gonna be it. I didn't want

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:33.180
hateful acts to overpower all these amazing things that people were doing. All these cool and positive things.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:38.800
But then something happened that I don't think anyone would have predicted.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:46.580
The Christchurch shooter said "Subscribe To PewDiePie" Out of the respect for the families and victims

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:53.580
involved, I chose not to address it any further than on Twitter, where I disavowed the actions taken that day and I

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:59.420
gave my sincerest condolences to everyone affected. To have my name

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.200
associated to- with something

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:07.979
so unspeakably vile has affected me in more ways than I let shown, I just didn't want to address it right away.

00:02:07.979 --> 00:02:11.249
And I didn't want to give the terrorist any more attention.

00:02:11.249 --> 00:02:12.980
I didn't want to make it about me

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.720
because I don't think it has anything to do with me. To put it plainly

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.860
I didn't want hate to win, but it's clear to me

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:25.990
now the "Subscribe To PewDiePie" movement should have ended then. Lastly my feelings around the

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:30.610
"Subscribe to PewDiePie" thing would not be complete without mentioning T-Series

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:35.499
Uhh, I made two diss tracks that were made in fun, ironic jests

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.280
They were not meant to be taken seriously, and

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:43.840
now High Court in India demands that they're gonna be blocked, and removed

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:50.700
This was all made to be fun, but it's clearly not fun anymore. It's clearly gone too far and out of respect for that

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:56.840
I'm gonna keep the videos blocked. On a similar note, some people in some media has made this

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:03.020
"Sub To PewDiePie" thing about race or about politics or nationality,

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:03.960
and

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.820
I don't agree with that at all

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.560
and I want that to stop.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:12.960
This negative rhetoric is something I don't agree with at all and I want that to stop and to make it perfectly clear:

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:19.340
No, I'm not racist. I don't support any form of racist comments or hate towards anyone.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.080
Finally,

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:24.680
I don't want hitting a hundred million subscribers to be about beating another channel.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:30.440
I think what we've accomplished is so much more than that, and I just want to say I feel

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.980
incredibly lucky to have such an amazing group of people supporting me

00:03:34.989 --> 00:03:39.429
I think I can say that because I know them better than anyone. I unironically,

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:45.070
I'm so proud of this community and this movement started out of love and support, so let's end it with that.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:50.960
I hope that you understand my perspective, and I ask you kindly to accept it. Thank you for listening.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.020
That's all, bye.

